# App empty copy

## Two surfaces only

1. **Status line** — in-flow hint while the page still has structure (`market-page-status`, `OsAppChromePageStatus`). One short sentence. No icon.
2. **True empty** — compose `market-page-empty` or `standing-panel-empty-state` (+ optional `OsEmptyAction`). Do not invent a third empty tree.

## Voice

Shared universals live in `@/lib/empty-copy` (`noMatches`, `nothingHereYet`, …). Domain lines stay local and human (`No fans yet.`, feed lens empties).

## Do not

- Slap a decorative Mage glyph (e.g. cup-hot) on every empty
- Turn status hints into hero empty cards when content continues below
- Hand-roll underlined recovery links — use `OsEmptyAction`
